herdsman is a modified version of herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The licence text is in LICENSE.

Every file taken from herdr has been modified: upstream/rename replaces the
herdr name throughout, in identifiers, paths, environment variables and URLs,
and removes herdr's own project files, such as its README, contribution policy,
logo and release history. herdsman's own changes, starting with stacked panes,
are recorded in this repository's history and in CHANGELOG.md, and
MAINTAINING.md describes how herdr releases are merged in.

